        "description_fr": "Accueilli par ses propriétaires, l'Hotel Boutique BC & Wine Casablanca propose des hébergements avec petit-déjeuner, des bains à remous au feu de cyprès et l'utilisation du sauna, inclus dans tous les tarifs. La connexion Wi-Fi est gratuite.\n\nL'hôtel propose 7 chambres doubles et 3 chambres triples. Vous pourrez demander des repas et un dîner moyennant des frais supplémentaires. Un service de navette est assuré moyennant des frais supplémentaires.\n\nVous séjournerez à 7 km de la vallée de Casablanca et de plusieurs vignobles, à 85 km de Santiago et à 59 km de Valparaiso.\n\nLes couples apprécient particulièrement l'emplacement de cet établissement. Ils lui donnent la note de 9,0 pour un séjour à deux.",
        "description_en": "Host by its owners, Hotel Boutique BC & Wine Casablanca offers accommodation with  breakfast, cypress-wood fired hot tubs and sauna usage, included in all rates. Free WiFi available at the property.\n\nThe hotel offers 7 double rooms and 3 triple rooms. Guests may request meals and dinner for an additional charge. There are also shuttle services are available for an extra fee.\n\nThe property is located 7 km away from Casablanca Valley and several wineries, 85 km from Santiago and 59 km from Valparaiso.\n\nCouples particularly like the location — they rated it 9.0 for a two-person trip.\n\nDistance in property description is calculated using © OpenStreetMap",
        "description_es": "El Hotel Boutique BC & Wine Casablanca está gestionado por sus propietarios y ofrece alojamiento con desayuno, bañeras de hidromasaje de madera de ciprés y uso de la sauna, incluido en todas las tarifas. Hay WiFi gratuita.\n\nEl hotel ofrece 7 habitaciones dobles y 3 habitaciones triples. Los huéspedes pueden solicitar comidas y cenas por un suplemento. También hay servicio de traslado disponible por un suplemento.\n\nEl establecimiento se encuentra a 7 km del valle de Casablanca y de varias bodegas, a 85 km de Santiago y a 59 km de Valparaíso.\n\nA las parejas les encanta la ubicación — Le han puesto un 9,0 para viajes de dos personas.\n\nLas distancias en la descripción del alojamiento se calculan con OpenStreetMap©",
        "description_pt": "Host by its owners, Hotel Boutique BC & Wine Casablanca offers accommodation with  breakfast, cypress-wood fired hot tubs and sauna usage, included in all rates. Free WiFi available at the property.\n\nThe hotel offers 7 double rooms and 3 triple rooms. Guests may request meals and dinner for an additional charge. There are also shuttle services are available for an extra fee.\n\nThe property is located 7 km away from Casablanca Valley and several wineries, 85 km from Santiago and 59 km from Valparaiso.\n\nOs casais gostam particularmente da localização – deram uma pontuação de 9,0 para uma viagem a dois.\n\nA distância mencionada na descrição do alojamento é calculada com o © OpenStreetMap",
        "description_it": "Host by its owners, Hotel Boutique BC & Wine Casablanca offers accommodation with  breakfast, cypress-wood fired hot tubs and sauna usage, included in all rates. Free WiFi available at the property.\n\nThe hotel offers 7 double rooms and 3 triple rooms. Guests may request meals and dinner for an additional charge. There are also shuttle services are available for an extra fee.\n\nThe property is located 7 km away from Casablanca Valley and several wineries, 85 km from Santiago and 59 km from Valparaiso.\n\nLe coppie apprezzano molto la posizione: l'hanno valutata 9,0 per un viaggio a due.\n\nLe distanze nella descrizione della struttura sono calcolate con © OpenStreetMap",
